# Files and checksums of `Systran/faster-whisper-tiny`

**Source of all numbers:** `results/files.csv`, `results/summary.json`, `results/provenance.md` and `results/run.log` (filtered client log) in `world/experiment-repo` at commit `1cf9d24c53d46a31e58500400ce9abef9aa04734` (produced by `scripts/run.py`). Nothing below was measured by this report's author.

## Setup

`pip install huggingface_hub` with default dependencies in a fresh venv, `HF_HUB_DISABLE_XET` unset, unauthenticated `snapshot_download` of `Systran/faster-whisper-tiny`, resolved revision `d90ca5fe260221311c53c58e660288d3deb8d356`. The repository holds 6 files (the API listing and the downloaded snapshot agree; no extras). SHA-256 was computed locally with `hashlib` on the downloaded files; sizes are the downloaded byte counts, equal to the API-reported size for all 6.

